---
// Maps all 9 parts of the series into three working layers plus the Part 9 feedback loop
// that sharpens both hand-coded UIs and AI code reviews.

const W = 900;
const H = 310;
---

<figure class="lsm">
  <div class="lsm-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Three-layer map of all nine parts of the series: Foundation (Parts 1 to 3), Surface and Type (Parts 4 to 7), and Craft and Feedback Loop (Parts 8 and 9), with a feedback arrow cycling from Part 9 back into better reviews and prompts.">
      <text x="20" y="26" class="lsm-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>How all 9 chapters connect as a diagnostic stack</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Cách 9 chương kết nối thành bộ công cụ chẩn đoán UI</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Layer 1: Structure (Ch 1-3) */}
      <g transform="translate(20, 48)">
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="268" height="176" rx="8" class="lsm-box" />
        <text x="16" y="28" class="lsm-col-t">
          <tspan data-lang-en>1. Structure (Parts 1–3)</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Cấu trúc (Bài 1–3)</tspan>
        </text>
        <line x1="16" x2="252" y1="40" y2="40" class="lsm-sep" />
        <text x="16" y="66" class="lsm-item">
          <tspan data-lang-en>Part 1 — Feature first, grayscale</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>Bài 1 — Tính năng trước, xám trước</tspan>
        </text>
        <text x="16" y="96" class="lsm-item">
          <tspan data-lang-en>Part 2 — Visual hierarchy</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>Bài 2 — Phân cấp thị giác</tspan>
        </text>
        <text x="16" y="126" class="lsm-item">
          <tspan data-lang-en>Part 3 — Layout & spacing scale</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>Bài 3 — Bố cục & thang khoảng cách</tspan>
        </text>
        <text x="16" y="160" class="lsm-foot">
          <tspan data-lang-en>Fixes: clutter & unclear actions</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>Sửa lỗi: rối mắt & nút không rõ chính phụ</tspan>
        </text>
      </g>

      {/* Arrow 1 -> 2 */}
      <line x1="292" x2="312" y1="136" y2="136" class="lsm-arrow" />
      <polygon points="316,136 308,131 308,141" class="lsm-arrow-head" />

      {/* Layer 2: Surface & Type (Ch 4-7) */}
      <g transform="translate(320, 48)">
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="268" height="176" rx="8" class="lsm-box" />
        <text x="16" y="28" class="lsm-col-t">
          <tspan data-lang-en>2. Surface & type (Parts 4–7)</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Chữ & bề mặt (Bài 4–7)</tspan>
        </text>
        <line x1="16" x2="252" y1="40" y2="40" class="lsm-sep" />
        <text x="16" y="64" class="lsm-item">
          <tspan data-lang-en>Part 4 — Type scale & leading</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>Bài 4 — Thang chữ & dãn dòng</tspan>
        </text>
        <text x="16" y="90" class="lsm-item">
          <tspan data-lang-en>Part 5 — HSL shade ladders</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>Bài 5 — Hệ sắc độ HSL</tspan>
        </text>
        <text x="16" y="116" class="lsm-item">
          <tspan data-lang-en>Part 6 — Light & two-part shadows</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>Bài 6 — Ánh sáng & bóng hai lớp</tspan>
        </text>
        <text x="16" y="142" class="lsm-item">
          <tspan data-lang-en>Part 7 — Images & safe overlays</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>Bài 7 — Ảnh & lớp phủ tương phản</tspan>
        </text>
        <text x="16" y="164" class="lsm-foot">
          <tspan data-lang-en>Fixes: muddy contrast & flat cards</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>Sửa lỗi: màu đục & giao diện phẳng lì</tspan>
        </text>
      </g>

      {/* Arrow 2 -> 3 */}
      <line x1="592" x2="612" y1="136" y2="136" class="lsm-arrow" />
      <polygon points="616,136 608,131 608,141" class="lsm-arrow-head" />

      {/* Layer 3: Craft & Feedback Loop (Ch 8-9) */}
      <g transform="translate(620, 48)">
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="260" height="176" rx="8" class="lsm-box is-accent" />
        <text x="16" y="28" class="lsm-col-t is-accent">
          <tspan data-lang-en>3. Craft loop (Parts 8–9)</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>3. Vòng lặp rèn nghề (Bài 8–9)</tspan>
        </text>
        <line x1="16" x2="244" y1="40" y2="40" class="lsm-sep is-accent" />
        <text x="16" y="68" class="lsm-item">
          <tspan data-lang-en>Part 8 — Finishing touches</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>Bài 8 — Chi tiết hoàn thiện</tspan>
        </text>
        <text x="16" y="102" class="lsm-item is-strong">
          <tspan data-lang-en>Part 9 — Study unexpected choices</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>Bài 9 — Soi quyết định bất ngờ</tspan>
        </text>
        <text x="16" y="128" class="lsm-item is-strong">
          <tspan data-lang-en>Part 9 — Rebuild without DevTools</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>Bài 9 — Dựng lại không mở DevTools</tspan>
        </text>
        <text x="16" y="160" class="lsm-foot is-accent">
          <tspan data-lang-en>Turns taste into a repeatable habit</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>Biến gu nhìn thành thói quen rèn được</tspan>
        </text>
      </g>

      {/* Feedback loop path from Layer 3 bottom back to Layer 1 bottom */}
      <path d="M 750 224 L 750 264 L 154 264 L 154 232" fill="none" class="lsm-loop" />
      <polygon points="154,226 149,235 159,235" class="lsm-loop-head" />
      <text x="452" y="286" text-anchor="middle" class="lsm-loop-lbl">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Each rebuild expands the visual vocabulary you bring to your next component or AI review</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Mỗi lần tự dựng lại làm giàu vốn nhìn cho component tiếp theo và lúc duyệt đồ AI tạo</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Parts 1 through 8 give you a diagnostic vocabulary; Part 9 turns that vocabulary into a feedback loop so your eye keeps improving after the series ends.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Bài 1 đến 8 cho bạn từ vựng chẩn đoán lỗi; Bài 9 biến nó thành vòng lặp luyện tập để mắt nhìn tiếp tục sắc hơn sau khi đọc hết series.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .lsm { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .lsm-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .lsm svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .lsm text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .lsm text.lsm-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .lsm-box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.25; }
  .lsm-box.is-accent { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .lsm text.lsm-col-t { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .lsm text.lsm-col-t.is-accent { fill: var(--red); }
  .lsm-sep { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .lsm-sep.is-accent { stroke: var(--red); opacity: 0.35; }
  .lsm text.lsm-item { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .lsm text.lsm-item.is-strong { font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .lsm text.lsm-foot { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .lsm text.lsm-foot.is-accent { fill: var(--red); }
  .lsm-arrow { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .lsm-arrow-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .lsm-loop { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.75; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .lsm-loop-head { fill: var(--red); }
  .lsm text.lsm-loop-lbl { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--red); }
  .lsm figcaption { margin-top: 0.6em; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }
</style>
